snapgene-deepreader
===================

This project is derived from SnapGeneReader:

    https://github.com/Edinburgh-Genome-Foundry/SnapGeneReader

SnapGeneReader is an MIT-licensed open-source project originally written by
Isaac Luo at the Cai Lab and maintained in the Edinburgh Genome Foundry fork.

The separate snapgene-deepreader package, including the package rename, richer
SnapGene block parsing, tests, and documentation in this repository, was
developed entirely by an AI coding agent.
